## Troubleshooting

| Problem | Fix |
|---|---|
| Board not found | Re-install esp32 Espressif package |
| Upload fails | Hold GPIO 0 LOW during upload |
| Camera error | Check partition is set to Huge APP |
| WiFi portal won't open | Power cycle the board |
